# AI Sentiment Analyzer

A Python-based AI tool that uses the OpenAI API to analyze and categorize the sentiment of developer communications into Positive, Negative, or Neutral.

## Project Structure

```text
/root/openaiproject/
├── venv/                  # Python virtual environment
├── sentiment_analyzer.py  # Main script for sentiment analysis
└── README.md              # Project documentation
Setup and Installation
Navigate to the project directory:

Bash
cd /root/openaiproject
Create and activate a virtual environment:

Bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
Install dependencies:

Bash
pip install openai
Load your environment variables:

Bash
source /root/.bash_profile
Usage
Run the sentiment analysis script:

Bash
python3 sentiment_analyzer.py
Preview / Example Output
Plaintext
